---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import Ex from "../components/Ex.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Pico CSS · 面向语义化 HTML 的极简 CSS 框架"
  desc="极简、轻量的起步套件，以语义化语法为先，让每个 HTML 元素默认就具备响应式与优雅的样式。"
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>写 HTML，就够了。</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Pico 是面向语义化 HTML 的极简 CSS 框架：每个元素开箱即是响应式、优雅的样式，不堆类名、不绑框架。引入一行 CSS，开始写文档。
      </p>
      <div class="color-strip" aria-hidden="true">
        {
          [
            "red", "pink", "fuchsia", "purple", "violet", "indigo", "blue", "azure",
            "cyan", "jade", "green", "lime", "yellow", "amber", "pumpkin", "orange",
            "sand", "grey", "zinc", "slate",
          ].map((c) => <span class={`pico-background-${c}-500`}></span>)
        }
      </div>
      <p class="cta-row">
        <a href="/docs/" role="button">阅读文档</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/picocss/pico" class="secondary outline" role="button" rel="noopener external" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-label="起步示例">
      <h2>12 行起步</h2>
      <p>手动安装或走 CDN，把 <code>pico.min.css</code> 挂进 <code>&lt;head&gt;</code>，剩下的交给语义标签：</p>
      <Ex
        html={`<main class="container" style="padding:0;max-width:none"><hgroup><h1>Hello world!</h1><h2>语义即样式</h2></hgroup><p>这是一段普通的 <a href="/docs/">HTML</a>。表单、表格、卡片、模态框，全部开箱可用。</p><form><input type="search" placeholder="搜索…"><button>搜索</button></form></main>`}
        code={`<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@picocss/pico@2/css/pico.min.css">
    <title>Hello world!</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="container">
      <h1>Hello world!</h1>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>`}
        lang="html"
        label="起步模板"
      />
      <p><a href="/docs/">查看完整文档 →</a></p>
    </section>

    <section aria-label="核心特性">
      <h2>恰到好处的一切</h2>
      <p>Pico 是「加强版 HTML 重置」，也是构建干净、轻量设计系统的起点。</p>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature-card">
          <h3>轻类且语义化</h3>
          <p>仅凭 CSS 即可获得出色样式，几乎不需要 class。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <h3>全面响应式</h3>
          <p>容器、栅格、排版在各断点自动适配。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <h3>浅色或深色模式</h3>
          <p>跟随系统偏好开箱即用，也可手动切换。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <h3>20 套配色主题</h3>
          <p>预编译调色板 CDN 直接引用，组合超过 100 种。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <h3>轻松定制</h3>
          <p>CSS 变量与 Sass 两条路线定制主题与组件。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <h3>性能优化</h3>
          <p>压缩后约 15 KB（gzip），零依赖、零 JavaScript。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a class="secondary" href="/docs/">文档</a></li>
        <li><a class="secondary" href="https://github.com/picocss/pico" rel="noopener external" target="_blank">GitHub</a></li>
      </ul>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <small>
            中文翻译自 <a href="https://picocss.com" rel="noopener external">picocss.com</a>，
            遵循 <a href="https://github.com/picocss/pico/blob/master/LICENSE.md" rel="noopener external">MIT 许可证</a>。
          </small>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  .cta-row a:first-child {
    display: inline-block;
  }
</style>
